    "content": "Three-drone coordination exercise: Drone 2, Drone 1, and Drone 3 take off together to 17 meters altitude, then hold formation at positions (649, 427, 17), (707, 579, 17), and (585, 846, 17) respectively for synchronized operation. Then all three drones move north for 74m, and next move east for 62m. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (north 74m, then east 62m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
    "content_aliases": [
      "Coordinate Drone 2, Drone 1, and Drone 3: ascend together to 17 meters, establish formation at positions (649, 427, 17), (707, 579, 17), and (585, 846, 17) respectively, then execute coordinated movement north 74m followed by east 62m. All drones must complete the full directional distance (north 74m, east 62m) from their respective positions, adjusting as needed to avoid obstacles.",
      "Three-drone formation drill: launch Drone 2, Drone 1, and Drone 3 to altitude 17m, hold stations at (649, 427, 17), (707, 579, 17), and (585, 846, 17) respectively, then shift north by 74 meters and east by 62 meters in synchronized operation. Each drone travels the specified distance in each direction regardless of obstacles encountered.",
      "Execute synchronized operation with Drone 2, Drone 1, Drone 3: take off reaching 17 meters height, maintain formation at coordinates (649, 427, 17), (707, 579, 17), and (585, 846, 17) respectively, then proceed north for 74m and subsequently east for 62m together, with each drone completing the full directed movements by repositioning around obstacles if necessary.",
      "Three-drone coordinated maneuver: Drone 2, Drone 1, and Drone 3 lift off to 17m elevation, hold formation positions at (649, 427, 17), (707, 579, 17), and (585, 846, 17) respectively, then travel north 74 meters and east 62 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
    ],
